# Automated Response & Containment
# --------------------------------
# Purpose:
# Execute proportionate security responses based on
# threat severity, balancing automation with control.

# High Severity Response
IF threat_severity == HIGH:
    disable affected identity
    revoke active authentication sessions
    isolate affected resource
    notify security team

# Medium Severity Response
ELSE IF threat_severity == MEDIUM:
    require step-up authentication
    increase monitoring and logging
